    m_HorizontalOverflow: 1
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\u2022 WASD: Karakter Hareketi & Konum Alma\n\u2022 Fare: Ni\u015Fan Alma
    ve Bak\u0131\u015F Y\xF6n\xFC\n\u2022 Sol T\u0131k: Siklon Vakum (At\u0131k Toplama
    & \u015Ei\u015Fen D\xFC\u015Fman\u0131 S\xF6n\xFCmleme)\n\u2022 Sa\u011F T\u0131k:
    Cam K\u0131r\u0131\u011F\u0131 Sa\xE7mas\u0131 (Geri D\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm \u015Earapneli
    / Shotgun)\n\u2022 Space: Eco-Dash (Hades Stili H\u0131zl\u0131 S\u0131yr\u0131lma
    & i-frame Ka\xE7\u0131\u015F)\n\u2022 [Q]: Pn\xF6matik Hurda Pistonu (A\u011F\u0131r
    \u0130tici / Duvara \xC7arpma Sersemletmesi)\n\u2022 [F]: Termal Is\u0131 Tahliyesi
    (Overheat Vent Blast / Is\u0131y\u0131 Bo\u015Falt ve Yak)\n\u2022 [R]: Toz Tank\u0131n\u0131
    Ar\u0131t (Eco-Hub Yan\u0131nda Bonuslu Silika)\n\u2022 [T]: Ye\u015Fil Ku\u015Fak
    Vaha A\u011Fac\u0131 Dik (\U0001F48E 8 Silika)\n\u2022 ESC: Duraklat / Pencereleri
    Kapat"
